# climatefind ghcn input
input/queue/*
# Per-station JSON dumps under spool/{meta,year,tmin,tmax} can grow to ~500MB
# total. Keep the bulky dirs ignored but commit the small summary CSV so the
# elevation-map regen never needs the raw GHCN archive again.
spool/*
!spool/comfy/
spool/comfy/*
!spool/comfy/year.csv
*.old.*/**
*.tar.gz
archive/tmp/*
ghcnd_all/
